     1	/* Single-producer / single-consumer lock-free ring from capture (obdd) to storage
     2	 * (storaged), its only consumer; analysis reads the committed log instead (D-031).
     3	 * It is the handoff mechanism E's process boundary needs. It is not claimed as
     4	 * mechanism F: Mode 01 rates never stress it, and no Pi-side sensor is added (D-029).
     5	 *
     6	 * The no-drop guarantee is the point. A gap in the record is a gap in the diagnosis,
     7	 * so a drop must be impossible to hide: every slot carries a sequence number and the
     8	 * consumer accounts for every one of them. If the ring is full the producer must
     9	 * report the overrun rather than silently overwrite an unread sample (DECISIONS B.3).
    10	 *
    11	 * Layout is fixed so the ring can live in shared memory across the process boundary
    12	 * that mechanism E requires.
    13	 */
